# {{PROJECT_NAME}} - Tutorial Hub (Empty)
# This is a placeholder for the tutorial hub. The full tutorial pack is not enabled.
# The full pack includes 17 interactive .vns lessons covering:
#   01–04: Dialogue, pacing, characters, backgrounds
#   05–08: Transitions, audio, variables, movement
#   09–12: Timelines, choices, subroutines, best practices
#   13–17: Camera, localization, UI layout, testing/release, VNS/JES integration
# Each lesson is a self-contained .vns file the player can open, edit, and learn from.

@scenario {{SCENARIO_PREFIX}}_tutorial_hub
@include {{CHARACTERS_INCLUDE}}

@label start
[show lavender center {{LAVENDER_EXPR}}]
narrator: This is the Tutorial Hub — {b}{{STORY_TUTORIAL_SCRIPT_PATH}}{/b}.
narrator: The sample tutorial pack is not included in this project.

narrator: The full pack adds 17 interactive VNS scripting lessons to {b}scripts/tutorial/{/b}:
narrator: Dialogue basics, narration and pacing, characters and expressions, backgrounds, transitions, audio, variables, movement, timelines, choices, subroutines, best practices, camera staging, localization, UI layout, testing, and VNS/JES integration.

narrator: To enable it, create a new project in the wizard and check {b}Sample Tutorial Pack{/b} under content options.
narrator: Each lesson is a real .vns file you can open in the editor, modify, and use as reference while building your game.
[end]
